// @domain: workforce | home: workforce
/// A staff member putting their hand up for an open shift.
///
/// A claim is a request, not an assignment: two people can claim the same
/// shift and a manager decides. That is deliberate — auto-assigning to
/// whoever taps first rewards whoever happens to be holding their phone,
